WEBVTT

00:03:00.070 --> 00:03:12.290
DEVILMAN

00:03:04.580 --> 00:03:12.500
"THE BIRTH"

00:03:48.560 --> 00:03:49.680
What is this?

00:03:50.640 --> 00:03:52.770
Prof. Fudo! By your foot!

00:04:01.700 --> 00:04:02.820
It's alive!

00:04:22.170 --> 00:04:23.340
Run!

00:04:28.260 --> 00:04:29.180
Dear!

00:04:32.270 --> 00:04:34.390
W-What happened to Yamanobe?

00:04:37.440 --> 00:04:38.770
Yamanobe!

00:05:50.890 --> 00:05:52.510
Usatarou...

00:05:54.020 --> 00:05:57.020
I'm so glad you're okay.

00:05:59.150 --> 00:06:00.020
How terrible!

00:06:04.360 --> 00:06:05.690
Poor thing.

00:06:06.650 --> 00:06:09.450
How could anyone be so cruel?

00:06:10.910 --> 00:06:12.030
Who's there?

00:06:19.460 --> 00:06:21.080
Oh?

00:06:21.420 --> 00:06:23.000
What's up?

00:06:23.000 --> 00:06:26.880
I don't usually see you
waiting around, Miki.

00:06:26.880 --> 00:06:28.510
Well, once in a while.

00:06:28.510 --> 00:06:31.890
I saw Fudo earlier at the rabbit hutch.

00:06:33.220 --> 00:06:37.310
Thank you. If he doesn't show up soon,
I'll go over there.

00:06:37.310 --> 00:06:40.520
Yeah? Well, good luck. Bye!

00:06:48.450 --> 00:06:51.490
Don't give me that!
You know who we are!

00:06:52.240 --> 00:06:56.120
It's the freeloader who's
staying with Makimura.

00:06:58.200 --> 00:07:03.000
"I'm so glad you're okay!
How terrible!"

00:07:07.210 --> 00:07:12.390
Hey, lover boy!
Is Miki your pet too?

00:07:13.720 --> 00:07:18.680
A cosy arrangement,
with your parents missing.

00:07:23.860 --> 00:07:26.900
You could take the rabbit's
place as target practice.

00:07:27.820 --> 00:07:29.740
Please, don't go.

00:07:33.530 --> 00:07:36.790
You better release the rabbit
before we really hurt you.

00:07:38.160 --> 00:07:42.790
Stop this... Uh, I beg of you.

00:07:45.630 --> 00:07:48.130
What's this begging crap?

00:07:52.970 --> 00:07:54.340
Now, hand over the rabbit!

00:07:59.890 --> 00:08:02.640
Masa wants it for practice.

00:08:15.070 --> 00:08:18.950
Give it up, kid.
He'll really kill you.

00:08:18.950 --> 00:08:19.950
Give him the bunny.

00:08:22.870 --> 00:08:23.370
No!

00:08:33.720 --> 00:08:35.930
Knock it off! You'll kill him!

00:08:37.510 --> 00:08:39.760
Hey, kid.

00:08:43.390 --> 00:08:45.980
You've got guts.
I underestimated you.

00:08:47.900 --> 00:08:53.820
But, next time be smarter
or you'll get yourself killed.

00:08:53.820 --> 00:08:55.360
We're busy here!

00:08:56.450 --> 00:08:57.620
Come back later.

00:08:57.620 --> 00:09:00.160
What are you guys being
so sneaky about?

00:09:00.160 --> 00:09:01.750
Akira!

00:09:02.200 --> 00:09:04.460
Here comes his keeper.
Let's go.

00:09:04.460 --> 00:09:07.000
Akira! Are you okay?

00:09:08.080 --> 00:09:09.460
Doesn't look like it...

00:09:11.050 --> 00:09:14.130
Hey, you guys! Hold it!

00:09:33.490 --> 00:09:36.280
What are you doing?
Hurry up, come here.

00:09:36.280 --> 00:09:39.070
It's just a scratch.
I'll be alright.

00:09:51.750 --> 00:09:57.130
No wonder they ran off.
One look at me would startle anyone.

00:09:57.550 --> 00:10:01.390
Next time I see those guys,
I'll kick their asses!

00:10:01.720 --> 00:10:05.480
You'd better not, Miki.
Don't get involved.

00:10:08.020 --> 00:10:11.610
What are you talking about?
I'm already involved.

00:10:12.360 --> 00:10:16.400
I can't sit by and let them
do this to one of my guests.

00:10:21.200 --> 00:10:22.870
Here, let me see your face.

00:10:23.790 --> 00:10:26.080
Ouch! I'll do it myself.

00:10:26.080 --> 00:10:29.620
You should let me do it. I'm used to
taking care of Tare.

00:10:41.890 --> 00:10:42.890
Thank you.

00:10:43.470 --> 00:10:48.140
You should think about yourself a little.
That will probably leave a scar.

00:10:49.350 --> 00:10:53.610
I was in shock earlier, I thought my heart
was gonna stop!

00:11:08.410 --> 00:11:11.330
Stupid!
It's late, let's go home.

00:11:13.250 --> 00:11:14.380
Miki!

00:11:28.600 --> 00:11:29.890
Let's take a shortcut.

00:11:53.210 --> 00:11:54.500
Miki...

00:11:55.880 --> 00:11:56.710
I...

00:11:59.130 --> 00:12:00.970
Well...

00:12:05.180 --> 00:12:06.390
Akira!

00:12:07.760 --> 00:12:09.520
Akira Fudo!

00:12:34.670 --> 00:12:36.040
It's Ryo!

00:12:37.250 --> 00:12:38.960
It's been awhile!

00:12:39.960 --> 00:12:43.340
This is my classmate from my last
school, Ryo Asuka.

00:12:44.130 --> 00:12:46.260
This is Miki Makimura.

00:12:47.010 --> 00:12:47.850
Nice to meet you.

00:12:49.510 --> 00:12:53.690
Akira, I need you.
Come to my house.

00:12:53.690 --> 00:12:55.020
Right now?

00:12:55.020 --> 00:12:55.650
Come.

00:12:58.190 --> 00:13:03.650
Hey, Asuka...
Today isn't good for Akira.

00:13:04.150 --> 00:13:05.530
He's been injured.

00:13:07.740 --> 00:13:10.910
And we were in the middle
of an important conversation.

00:13:11.490 --> 00:13:13.540
Our business is much more important.

00:13:16.420 --> 00:13:17.630
Wait!

00:13:18.460 --> 00:13:19.590
Akira!

00:13:20.590 --> 00:13:22.210
Are you really leaving with him?

00:13:22.460 --> 00:13:24.840
Yeah, he's acting kind of weird...

00:13:24.840 --> 00:13:27.680
I get it. He's pretty, isn't he?

00:13:27.680 --> 00:13:30.560
Miki! Ryo is a guy!

00:13:34.310 --> 00:13:36.520
Alright, then I'll go too!

00:13:39.940 --> 00:13:42.360
Ryo, would it be a problem if
Miki came with?

00:13:45.110 --> 00:13:46.240
Stop it, Ryo!

00:13:46.650 --> 00:13:49.490
I have no need for her.
There's no time.

00:13:49.490 --> 00:13:50.620
Please come, Akira.

00:14:14.970 --> 00:14:18.980
Why are you carrying
such a dangerous thing?

00:14:19.690 --> 00:14:21.900
I think I'm in danger.

00:14:21.900 --> 00:14:24.190
But, what if you hurt someone?

00:14:24.190 --> 00:14:24.980
I don't care.

00:14:33.580 --> 00:14:34.620
My father died.

00:14:39.710 --> 00:14:44.000
But, he seemed fine
the last time I saw him.

00:14:44.550 --> 00:14:47.010
He didn't die from an illness.

00:14:47.380 --> 00:14:49.010
It was suicide.

00:14:49.010 --> 00:14:51.800
He doused himself in gasoline
and lit a match.

00:14:55.100 --> 00:15:00.020
He kept pouring the gasoline on
himself until the end.

00:15:06.650 --> 00:15:12.160
One morning, I found my canary dead.
Its body ripped to pieces.

00:15:12.160 --> 00:15:13.660
That's when it started.

00:15:19.500 --> 00:15:24.090
Next, I found my dog John, beheaded.

00:15:25.550 --> 00:15:27.260
Father, John is...

00:15:28.970 --> 00:15:32.140
It's fine, Ryo. Don't worry.

00:15:41.890 --> 00:15:46.690
That dog went mad.
I had to put him down.

00:15:46.690 --> 00:15:51.070
Don't worry.
I'll get you a new dog.

00:15:51.070 --> 00:15:55.830
Yes, I'll get you one large
enough to be worth killing!

00:16:32.400 --> 00:16:33.030
Father!

00:16:36.740 --> 00:16:37.910
Father!

00:16:43.210 --> 00:16:45.960
He tried to kill you?!

00:16:47.340 --> 00:16:48.750
And then, he died.

00:17:01.680 --> 00:17:05.940
His charred body was twice as heavy
as when he was alive!

00:17:07.190 --> 00:17:08.940
But his size never changed...

00:17:14.110 --> 00:17:16.410
Only his weight doubled.

00:17:16.410 --> 00:17:19.830
No way. It's like a ghost story...

00:17:19.830 --> 00:17:23.580
My father left me an inheritance.
A terrifying one.

00:17:23.580 --> 00:17:25.750
Something I wish I'd never seen.

00:17:26.920 --> 00:17:30.170
But now that I know...
I have to face it.

00:17:30.170 --> 00:17:33.840
However, it's not something
I can handle by myself.

00:17:34.260 --> 00:17:39.850
Akira Fudo, I want to share my father's
horrifying inheritance with you.

00:19:03.350 --> 00:19:04.720
Don't I have to take my shoes off?

00:19:04.720 --> 00:19:05.810
It doesn't matter.

00:19:06.770 --> 00:19:09.100
You knew that my father
was an archaeologist.

00:19:09.100 --> 00:19:12.190
Of course. He was famous.

00:19:12.810 --> 00:19:15.610
It began when he was surveying
some Mayan ruins.

00:19:16.400 --> 00:19:21.360
While in the jungle nearby, he slipped
into a hole masked by the underbrush.

00:19:22.200 --> 00:19:26.990
It was a narrow hole at the surface,
but it went down very deep.

00:19:29.790 --> 00:19:33.250
He slid for a long time down a steep incline.

00:19:37.210 --> 00:19:40.260
And at the bottom, he
discovered something strange.

00:19:46.010 --> 00:19:48.350
Hey, it's so dark...

00:19:50.390 --> 00:19:52.270
What about the lights?

00:19:53.020 --> 00:19:56.230
We can see without the lights.
Look!

00:20:00.570 --> 00:20:01.820
A monster!

00:20:03.280 --> 00:20:05.450
Take a good look.
It's artificial.

00:20:06.740 --> 00:20:07.830
Artificial?

00:20:08.240 --> 00:20:09.580
What does it look like to you?

00:20:10.330 --> 00:20:12.080
T-The Devil.

00:20:14.460 --> 00:20:18.170
It's mankind's image of the Devil, certainly.

00:20:18.170 --> 00:20:20.460
Was it created by an
ancient civilization?

00:20:20.760 --> 00:20:26.300
No, no human being made this.
Humans didn't exist yet.

00:20:26.930 --> 00:20:31.060
It comes from before the Great Flood,
from before the Ice Age, even.

00:20:32.390 --> 00:20:35.060
But... It doesn't look natural.

00:20:35.480 --> 00:20:38.860
Right. It was definitely crafted.

00:20:38.860 --> 00:20:42.070
How? You said humans
didn't exist yet.

00:20:44.700 --> 00:20:47.910
What if it was made by
something other than human?

00:20:47.910 --> 00:20:49.490
Other than human?

00:20:50.040 --> 00:20:54.250
The primeval dwellers of the Earth,
the demons! Devils, to be precise.

00:21:02.760 --> 00:21:04.970
Demons had no written language.

00:21:04.970 --> 00:21:07.760
They wove their memories into these.

00:21:07.760 --> 00:21:10.060
It's a demon history book.

00:21:10.970 --> 00:21:11.930
Ryo!

00:21:11.930 --> 00:21:14.560
The history of the world of
demons is projected...

00:21:14.560 --> 00:21:20.270
...directly into the brain of whoever
wears this thing.

00:21:20.900 --> 00:21:23.280
Akira, please put this on.

00:21:24.700 --> 00:21:26.820
It gives me the creeps...

00:21:26.820 --> 00:21:27.570
Put it on!

00:21:28.120 --> 00:21:30.870
M-Maybe next time...

00:21:30.870 --> 00:21:31.910
Akira!

00:21:33.000 --> 00:21:35.160
My father gave his life for this!

00:21:36.290 --> 00:21:39.590
If you don't put it on, you'll never learn
the reason for his suicide.

00:21:40.170 --> 00:21:42.880
You still won't do it?

00:21:42.880 --> 00:21:44.550
Okay, Ryo.

00:21:51.680 --> 00:21:55.310
Don't take it off.
Look! Look closely!

00:21:55.310 --> 00:21:57.140
That is the world of the devils!

00:23:51.220 --> 00:23:53.930
Just as humans developed weapons,

00:23:53.930 --> 00:23:56.140
demons developed the power of fusion.

00:23:57.600 --> 00:24:00.940
Demons with this ability,
in order to grow stronger...

00:24:00.940 --> 00:24:03.230
...would combine with others
over and over...

00:24:03.230 --> 00:24:07.610
...until they became grotesque
creatures with strange powers.

00:24:10.780 --> 00:24:14.370
I can't believe that
devils really existed!

00:24:14.660 --> 00:24:18.370
I see this has been shocking for you.
I know how sensitive you are.

00:24:31.550 --> 00:24:33.970
I suppose mankind was lucky.

00:24:33.970 --> 00:24:36.220
The demons perished...

00:24:36.220 --> 00:24:40.180
...which meant there were no terrible enemies
to oppose mankind's evolution.

00:24:40.180 --> 00:24:41.390
Or did they?

00:24:42.060 --> 00:24:46.270
If demons were really extinct,
how would humans know about them?

00:24:46.860 --> 00:24:50.150
What about the legends of demons
from all over the world?

00:24:50.940 --> 00:24:55.410
Until now, the Devil was thought to be
a figment of imagination, just like God.

00:24:55.410 --> 00:24:57.780
But, devils did exist!

00:24:59.200 --> 00:25:01.870
Have you heard of
"The Divine Comedy" by Dante?

00:25:01.870 --> 00:25:03.330
No.

00:25:03.330 --> 00:25:07.250
Dante was an ltalian poet
of the 13th century.

00:25:07.250 --> 00:25:12.210
He wrote a tale of a journey through
Hell, Purgatory and Heaven.

00:25:12.590 --> 00:25:18.850
He describes the deepest pit of Hell
where the Devil is entombed in ice.

00:25:19.720 --> 00:25:24.810
In dreadful cold, Lucifer, the
giant bat-winged Lord of Demons...

00:25:24.810 --> 00:25:28.810
...Is buried up to his chest in ice,
suffering in motionless torment.

00:25:29.650 --> 00:25:31.820
What do you think of this story?

00:25:33.570 --> 00:25:40.120
Maybe a demon was trapped during
the Ice Age. Maybe Dante really saw it.

00:25:40.120 --> 00:25:45.040
The demon was trapped in his icy prison,
in suspended animation. Still alive.

00:25:45.040 --> 00:25:51.000
Now it is about to be reborn in our
modern world to claim the Earth once more.

00:25:55.220 --> 00:25:57.470
No...

00:25:57.680 --> 00:26:02.470
What would happen if I asked the army
to go to Antarctica to kill the Devil?

00:26:04.100 --> 00:26:06.520
They'd think I was crazy.

00:26:07.810 --> 00:26:11.070
Demons know that, without weapons,
mankind is weak.

00:26:11.650 --> 00:26:14.400
So, before mankind can take up arms...

00:26:14.400 --> 00:26:17.150
Before they can learn of the
existence of demons...

00:26:17.150 --> 00:26:21.910
They will slink in like shadows,
and kill us all.

00:26:21.910 --> 00:26:24.750
That's crazy! Humanity
isn't defenseless!

00:26:24.750 --> 00:26:26.910
We have terrible weapons!
The hydrogen bomb!

00:26:26.910 --> 00:26:31.500
Demons develop their bodies the same
way we develop weapons.

00:26:31.630 --> 00:26:34.170
There may be one with the
power of a hydrogen bomb.

00:26:34.590 --> 00:26:37.720
Demons love nothing more than fighting.

00:26:38.300 --> 00:26:40.680
They delight in the slaughter
of the living.

00:26:42.890 --> 00:26:45.810
There is no love
in the heart of a demon.

00:26:45.810 --> 00:26:47.020
They are devils indeed.

00:26:50.230 --> 00:26:53.360
It can't be!
How can you be so sure?

00:26:53.360 --> 00:26:56.650
It's something my father
sacrificed himself to learn.

00:26:58.740 --> 00:27:01.660
In order to find out how demons think...

00:27:02.870 --> 00:27:04.280
...my father united with one.

00:27:05.660 --> 00:27:08.410
His diary and will
explained everything.

00:27:09.120 --> 00:27:11.630
Why he had to die...

00:27:13.840 --> 00:27:16.760
...and how to battle the demons.

00:27:18.220 --> 00:27:20.840
That is the inheritance he left me.

00:27:22.090 --> 00:27:24.640
Is that the terrible thing
you spoke of before?

00:27:24.640 --> 00:27:26.970
Yes, that's right.

00:27:27.770 --> 00:27:28.640
Follow me.

00:27:33.860 --> 00:27:34.690
It's underground.

00:27:48.160 --> 00:27:49.120
A demon!

00:27:53.330 --> 00:27:54.250
Akira!

00:28:33.370 --> 00:28:34.250
It's here!

00:28:39.710 --> 00:28:41.050
Hold on tight!

00:28:56.230 --> 00:28:57.480
Die!

00:29:06.740 --> 00:29:07.740
It's still alive!

00:29:08.700 --> 00:29:09.410
Use this.

00:29:11.120 --> 00:29:13.410
No way... I can't!

00:29:14.410 --> 00:29:16.790
If you don't want to die,
then shoot!

00:29:17.130 --> 00:29:18.840
N-No way...

00:29:23.920 --> 00:29:24.720
What's wrong?

00:29:25.800 --> 00:29:26.260
Dammit!

00:29:44.610 --> 00:29:47.700
A demon! It's taken over the car!
The door!

00:29:51.120 --> 00:29:52.870
No good! It won't open!

00:29:52.870 --> 00:29:55.080
Come on! Break the window!

00:30:00.500 --> 00:30:01.880
Ryo!

00:30:16.520 --> 00:30:17.600
Run!

00:30:44.090 --> 00:30:46.920
So, this is a demon...

00:30:48.680 --> 00:30:49.510
Yes.

00:30:53.850 --> 00:31:00.520
Akira, I'm sorry for dragging
you into all of this...

00:31:01.980 --> 00:31:06.400
...but everyone except you
looks like the enemy to me.

00:31:06.400 --> 00:31:11.660
You are the only one I can trust,
Akira Fudo.

00:31:13.410 --> 00:31:14.580
Please understand...

00:31:39.940 --> 00:31:40.390
Akira!

00:31:44.020 --> 00:31:44.980
Shoot!

00:32:15.140 --> 00:32:16.180
Akira!

00:32:17.260 --> 00:32:18.140
Akira.

00:32:22.140 --> 00:32:23.770
The demon is dead.

00:32:25.230 --> 00:32:26.650
You did well.

00:32:34.240 --> 00:32:35.780
Let's head back.

00:32:44.040 --> 00:32:49.130
My parents were eaten
by some creature at the glacier.

00:32:49.880 --> 00:32:51.130
Could it be...

00:32:51.130 --> 00:32:56.010
I don't know.
I don't know, but... it probably was.

00:32:58.930 --> 00:33:01.480
You said there was a way
we could fight the demons.

00:33:03.640 --> 00:33:07.020
And that was your father's
terrifying inheritance.

00:33:51.650 --> 00:33:52.440
It's coming!

00:34:07.710 --> 00:34:10.500
There's no escape for us now.

00:34:11.590 --> 00:34:12.340
Yeah.

00:34:18.220 --> 00:34:19.930
I'll take on your inheritance.

00:34:21.760 --> 00:34:24.770
Ryo, tell it to me straight.

00:34:24.770 --> 00:34:27.810
What is this terrifying inheritance
you've talked about?

00:34:28.690 --> 00:34:33.780
There can't be many ways to fight
monsters with supernatural powers.

00:34:33.780 --> 00:34:35.320
I can only think of one.

00:34:36.110 --> 00:34:37.950
You already knew...

00:34:37.950 --> 00:34:41.830
You chose to accept my inheritance,
knowing what it would mean.

00:34:42.410 --> 00:34:48.080
The only way to fight the demons
is to become a demon yourself.

00:34:50.130 --> 00:34:52.420
Do you know what this means, Akira?

00:34:52.420 --> 00:34:55.010
What it means to no longer be human?

00:34:55.010 --> 00:34:59.680
All the happiness... the sorrow...
the essence of life itself...

00:34:59.680 --> 00:35:01.600
All of it must be abandoned.

00:35:06.730 --> 00:35:09.520
These are the last words
of my father's will.

00:35:09.520 --> 00:35:13.270
Only one kind of human can
unite with a demon...

00:35:13.270 --> 00:35:16.320
...and gain its power, while
maintaining their humanity.

00:35:16.320 --> 00:35:22.410
Someone with a pure heart, and a will
powerful enough to hold the demon back.

00:35:22.410 --> 00:35:24.990
A young man who loves justice.

00:35:25.620 --> 00:35:29.620
That's why I have chosen you,
Akira Fudo!

00:35:35.210 --> 00:35:39.760
I don't know... I guess I have the
"young man" part down, at least...

00:35:40.260 --> 00:35:44.470
Don't worry. I believe in you.

00:35:45.560 --> 00:35:49.140
What if I realize I can't
hold the demon back?

00:35:49.140 --> 00:35:51.310
Then choose death,
like my father.

00:35:53.940 --> 00:36:00.150
At best, I'll transform and
fight the demons until my death.

00:36:01.030 --> 00:36:05.490
At worst, I become a monster
and burn myself to death.

00:36:06.370 --> 00:36:09.410
And you won't get to
choose between them.

00:36:09.410 --> 00:36:12.210
It all depends on how
the union goes.

00:36:12.210 --> 00:36:14.290
Truly a terrifying inheritance!

00:36:14.710 --> 00:36:17.380
It is a tremendous burden
my father left.

00:36:18.210 --> 00:36:22.510
Ryo, you're my Lord Enma
guiding me straight to Hell!

00:36:39.820 --> 00:36:42.780
Let's go, Enma!
Open the gates of Hell!

00:36:44.860 --> 00:36:47.580
This is the entrance to Hell...
The Sanzu River!

00:37:14.230 --> 00:37:15.230
What is this?!

00:37:18.610 --> 00:37:21.150
What is this? Some kind of joke?

00:37:32.330 --> 00:37:33.120
Ryo!

00:37:34.000 --> 00:37:35.460
It's the Sabbath.

00:37:35.460 --> 00:37:38.710
There have long been two kinds of
ceremonies regarding the Devil.

00:37:38.710 --> 00:37:41.590
The Black Mass and the Sabbath.

00:37:42.760 --> 00:37:46.720
My father thought that these
ceremonies created the conditions...

00:37:46.720 --> 00:37:50.510
...that made it easier
for humans to join with demons.

00:37:50.510 --> 00:37:53.600
You mean all of this is necessary
for the transformation?

00:37:54.020 --> 00:37:55.520
That's right.

00:37:55.520 --> 00:38:01.270
Demons can combine with any creature,
yet they rarely combine with humans.

00:38:01.270 --> 00:38:05.610
That's because humans have one trait
that demons abhor.

00:38:06.110 --> 00:38:07.450
Their reason.

00:38:07.450 --> 00:38:11.620
The one thing that keeps humans
human. Reason.

00:38:11.620 --> 00:38:18.580
Since demons live to satisfy their
instincts, they despise reason.

00:38:19.540 --> 00:38:24.630
So, to unite with a demon,
I must abandon all reason.

00:38:25.090 --> 00:38:29.640
Exactly! When a human abandons their
reason and acts only on instinct,

00:38:29.640 --> 00:38:31.640
that is when a demon and
a human can unite!

00:38:32.100 --> 00:38:35.140
The people I gathered here
are small-time hoodlums.

00:38:35.560 --> 00:38:39.150
They seek only pleasure.
They are used to abandoning their reason.

00:38:39.730 --> 00:38:43.530
Hanging out with them would make
it easy for us to do the same, right?

00:38:45.280 --> 00:38:46.320
Drink this.

00:38:48.700 --> 00:38:53.790
Hold it, Ryo! Won't these people
become demons too?

00:38:54.120 --> 00:38:57.040
Yes, they will all transform.

00:38:57.040 --> 00:39:01.290
But, I've told them nothing. They have
no knowledge of the demons.

00:39:02.630 --> 00:39:03.590
That means...

00:39:03.590 --> 00:39:09.130
As soon as they become possessed,
they will lose their souls.

00:39:09.130 --> 00:39:14.560
When we unite with the demons
they will all become our enemies.

00:39:14.560 --> 00:39:16.180
But...

00:39:16.180 --> 00:39:21.150
If that's true, it's all of them against us!
We'll be killed immediately!

00:39:21.150 --> 00:39:23.690
We can't beat all those demons!

00:39:23.690 --> 00:39:25.730
And yet, we must beat them!

00:39:25.730 --> 00:39:28.780
Think about what we're going to have to do!

00:39:29.320 --> 00:39:32.780
You and I alone must fight
against thousands of demons!

00:39:33.370 --> 00:39:37.040
If we can't join with a demon
strong enough to defeat this many...

00:39:37.040 --> 00:39:38.790
...then there's no point in joining at all!

00:39:43.590 --> 00:39:47.210
It's unlikely that both of us will survive.

00:39:47.840 --> 00:39:53.800
But if one of us does,
the survivor must protect humanity.

00:39:54.220 --> 00:39:57.520
We can't hand the Earth over to them.

00:40:02.900 --> 00:40:06.480
What are you doing just talking
with another guy?

00:40:06.480 --> 00:40:08.780
Come on, dance with me!

00:40:08.780 --> 00:40:10.740
Hang on! Ryo!

00:40:33.680 --> 00:40:36.720
The Black Mass teaches us
one other thing...

00:40:36.720 --> 00:40:38.600
Demons love blood!

00:41:00.620 --> 00:41:02.870
I will bathe this room in blood!

00:41:02.870 --> 00:41:03.830
Bastard!

00:41:22.060 --> 00:41:23.520
Stop it!

00:41:24.890 --> 00:41:27.900
I hate fighting and I despise blood!

00:41:27.900 --> 00:41:31.190
Shut up!
Your friend started this!

00:41:32.690 --> 00:41:35.700
Come on, kid!
Get a grip on yourself!

00:41:37.280 --> 00:41:41.120
You want mama's tits, huh?

00:41:41.120 --> 00:41:43.160
Suck on this, brat!

00:42:42.810 --> 00:42:43.390
Ryo!

00:42:43.850 --> 00:42:46.890
Akira, is anything
happening to your body?

00:42:46.890 --> 00:42:49.060
No! I don't feel anything!

00:42:49.060 --> 00:42:50.860
Damn, we failed!

00:43:46.080 --> 00:43:47.540
I have it now!

00:43:47.540 --> 00:43:53.210
I have... the body of a demon!

00:44:02.840 --> 00:44:03.930
I am...

00:44:06.140 --> 00:44:07.470
...Devilman!

00:44:18.190 --> 00:44:20.030
What are you doing, Amon?

00:44:20.030 --> 00:44:21.280
He's gone mad!

00:44:24.370 --> 00:44:25.990
I am not Amon!

00:44:25.990 --> 00:44:30.830
I am the devil born to wipe you
demons from the face of Earth!

00:44:31.330 --> 00:44:32.710
Devilman!

00:44:32.710 --> 00:44:35.460
Your consciousness has been
conquered by a human!

00:44:36.000 --> 00:44:39.420
It is I who has conquered
the demon's body...

00:44:39.420 --> 00:44:41.760
and his supernatural powers!

00:45:33.890 --> 00:45:37.270
Is that...
Is that really Akira?

00:45:38.520 --> 00:45:41.780
The gentle and sensitive
Akira Fudo?

00:45:44.110 --> 00:45:46.360
He finds pleasure in battle...

00:45:46.360 --> 00:45:48.120
...and rejoices in slaughter!

00:45:49.280 --> 00:45:50.620
To me, he appears...

00:45:51.990 --> 00:45:53.750
...much worse than a devil!

00:45:55.080 --> 00:45:57.500
He has become
a devil among devils!

00:45:58.250 --> 00:46:01.460
Could it be...
By trying to create mankind's ally...

00:46:01.460 --> 00:46:04.510
...I may have created
our worst enemy!

00:46:47.430 --> 00:46:50.050
Oh, no! Ryo!
Ryo!

00:46:56.560 --> 00:47:00.690
If Ryo transformed,
I might have killed him too!

00:47:01.610 --> 00:47:03.770
Ryo! Where are you?

00:47:04.730 --> 00:47:05.280
Ryo!

00:47:10.740 --> 00:47:12.200
Ryo!

00:47:12.700 --> 00:47:15.790
Don't leave me alone in this Hell!

00:47:15.790 --> 00:47:16.700
Ryo!

00:47:18.790 --> 00:47:20.330
You can't die, Ryo!

00:47:21.750 --> 00:47:23.790
Ryo!
